 -------------------------
 
 👩🏽‍💻 Authors
@@ -26,6 +26,10 @@ The following authors contributed for the first time. Thank you so much! 🤩
 The following authors had contributed before. Thank you for sticking around! 🤘
 
 * `Bruno Aristimunha`_
+* `Daniel McCloy`_
+* `Eric Larson`_
